stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Reset
    Reset --> Acting: fixed concrete seed
    Acting --> Stepping: legal action
    Stepping --> Accumulating: raw reward + flags
    Accumulating --> Acting: no done
    Accumulating --> EnvironmentTerminated: terminated
    Accumulating --> EnvironmentTruncated: truncated
    EnvironmentTerminated --> Recorded: preserve env flags
    EnvironmentTruncated --> Recorded: preserve env flags
    Recorded --> [*]
